{"id":"u04","level":"A1","emoji":"🍽️","title":{"t":"Food and drink","s":"غذا و نوشیدنی","a":"audio/en-fa/c789f2f86058.mp3"},"goals":["اسم چند غذا و نوشیدنی را بگویم.","a، an و some را درست به‌کار ببرم.","بگویم چه چیزی را دوست دارم و چه چیزی را دوست ندارم.","مؤدبانه چیزی بخواهم: I'd like …, please."],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"bread","s":"نان","pr":"برِد","emoji":"🍞","ex":{"t":"I like bread and cheese.","s":"من نان و پنیر دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/5602abed063d.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f35e.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/62d431480643.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"rice","s":"برنج","pr":"رایس","emoji":"🍚","ex":{"t":"I'd like some rice, please.","s":"لطفاً کمی برنج می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/e96db575cfbb.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f35a.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/0be1fe8447f5.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"tea","s":"چای","pr":"تی","emoji":"🍵","ex":{"t":"We like tea.","s":"ما چای دوست داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/47cb2318777c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f375.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/72fde7c2ddbf.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"coffee","s":"قهوه","pr":"کافی","emoji":"☕","ex":{"t":"I don't like coffee.","s":"من قهوه دوست ندارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/caec867e4544.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2615.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/93ad90e67c84.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"water","s":"آب","pr":"واتِر","emoji":"💧","ex":{"t":"Some water, please.","s":"کمی آب، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/80e06577191e.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4a7.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/bea196109320.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"milk","s":"شیر","pr":"میلک","emoji":"🥛","ex":{"t":"We have some milk.","s":"ما کمی شیر داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/ee8ddcfa1138.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f95b.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/a16bfc75d3d4.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"juice","s":"آبمیوه","pr":"جوس","emoji":"🧃","ex":{"t":"I'd like an orange juice, please.","s":"لطفاً یک آب‌پرتقال می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/a5354a72168a.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9c3.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/fbe6541c08e5.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"egg","pl":"eggs","s":"تخم‌مرغ","pr":"اِگ","emoji":"🥚","ex":{"t":"I'd like two eggs, please.","s":"لطفاً دو تا تخم‌مرغ می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/0777a6c23a2b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f95a.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/f47803470261.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/3f0a68c7dc0f.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"cheese","s":"پنیر","pr":"چیز","emoji":"🧀","ex":{"t":"Do you like cheese?","s":"پنیر دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/9e53bf569292.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9c0.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/f0d51cfdef25.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"chicken","s":"مرغ (گوشت مرغ)","pr":"چیکِن","emoji":"🍗","ex":{"t":"We like chicken and rice.","s":"ما مرغ و برنج دوست داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/0591537c8d89.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f357.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/43ad155df6cc.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"apple","pl":"apples","s":"سیب","pr":"اَپِل","emoji":"🍎","ex":{"t":"An apple, please.","s":"یک سیب، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/f0115c09bbe8.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34e.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/049b18bb5433.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/6b9660ae9202.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"orange","pl":"oranges","s":"پرتقال","pr":"اورِنج","emoji":"🍊","ex":{"t":"I have an orange.","s":"من یک پرتقال دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/18377917fb42.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34a.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/0a8dc80e6d47.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/ca3361d3f43c.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"banana","pl":"bananas","s":"موز","pr":"بِنَنا","emoji":"🍌","ex":{"t":"They like bananas.","s":"آن‌ها موز دوست دارند.","a":"audio/en-fa/e4cce4b78060.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34c.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/76992f4542b3.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/6c2e47e27929.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"breakfast","s":"صبحانه","pr":"برِکفِست","emoji":"🍳","ex":{"t":"We have bread and cheese for breakfast.","s":"ما صبحانه نان و پنیر می‌خوریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/19977bce6a3b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f373.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/f6cb874d6938.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"I'd like …, please.","s":"لطفاً … می‌خواهم.","pr":"آید لایک …، پلیز.","a":"audio/en-fa/463f4cab2581.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Would you like some tea?","s":"چای میل دارید؟","pr":"وود یو لایک سام تی؟","a":"audio/en-fa/5b3cfe392130.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Do you like …?","s":"… دوست داری؟","pr":"دو یو لایک …؟","a":"audio/en-fa/d1a4c0001b56.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Yes, I do. / No, I don't.","s":"بله، دوست دارم. / نه، دوست ندارم.","pr":"یِس، آی دو. / نُو، آی دُونت.","a":"audio/en-fa/5a37bf113caa.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","pr":"هیر یو آر.","a":"audio/en-fa/ffbb0dd0fb8a.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"I'm hungry.","s":"گرسنه‌ام.","pr":"آیم هانگری.","a":"audio/en-fa/de1480d4dad7.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"It's delicious!","s":"خیلی خوشمزه است!","pr":"ایتس دیلیشِس!","a":"audio/en-fa/46e4308a768c.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Enjoy your meal!","s":"نوش جان!","pr":"اِنجوی یور میل!","a":"audio/en-fa/6357fe690b32.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"At Maryam's house","s":"در خانهٔ مریم","a":"audio/en-fa/0d54a933d1a3.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Maryam","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Tom","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hello, Tom! Would you like some tea?","s":"سلام تام! چای میل داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/663a53948441.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, please. I like tea.","s":"بله، لطفاً. من چای دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/182e2d30c5a9.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرما.","a":"audio/en-fa/ffbb0dd0fb8a.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Thank you!","s":"ممنون!","a":"audio/en-fa/a9800052836d.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Are you hungry?","s":"گرسنه هستی؟","a":"audio/en-fa/ad424b6312f3.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, I am.","s":"بله، گرسنه‌ام.","a":"audio/en-fa/35d8657aa591.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"We have rice and chicken. Do you like chicken?","s":"برنج و مرغ داریم. مرغ دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/40e667f8b0c7.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, I do! I'd like some rice and chicken, please.","s":"بله، دوست دارم! لطفاً کمی برنج و مرغ می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/58a7f7e43c94.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Enjoy your meal!","s":"نوش جان!","a":"audio/en-fa/6357fe690b32.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Mmm, it's delicious!","s":"به‌به، خیلی خوشمزه است!","a":"audio/en-fa/e36fcea3597d.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"a / an / some","s":"a، an و some"},"explain":"**a** و **an** یعنی «یک» و قبل از اسمِ مفرد می‌آیند.\nاگر کلمهٔ بعدی با صدای صدادار (مثل a، e، i، o) شروع شود، **an** می‌گوییم: **an** apple، **an** egg، **an** orange. بقیه با **a** می‌آیند: **a** banana، **a** son.\nبعضی چیزها شمردنی نیستند، مثل water، tea، rice و milk. با آن‌ها **a** نمی‌گوییم، بلکه **some** (کمی، مقداری): **some** water، **some** rice.\nبا اسم جمع هم **some** می‌آید: **some** apples (چند سیب).","table":[["a","a banana","a son"],["an","an apple","an egg"],["some","some water","some apples"]],"examples":[{"t":"I'd like an apple.","s":"یک سیب می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/7b0d7d433a05.mp3"},{"t":"Ali has a banana.","s":"علی یک موز دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/bbf21d3d9a3f.mp3"},{"t":"We have some bread.","s":"ما کمی نان داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/b4ff1e9b537e.mp3"},{"t":"Some eggs, please.","s":"چند تا تخم‌مرغ، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/c808d00d86d7.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"I'd like ___ egg, please.","options":["a","an"],"answer":1,"s":"لطفاً یک تخم‌مرغ می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like an egg, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/1cb069aacdec.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ali has ___ banana.","options":["a","an"],"answer":0,"s":"علی یک موز دارد.","full":"Ali has a banana.","a":"audio/en-fa/bbf21d3d9a3f.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"We have ___ water.","options":["a","an","some"],"answer":2,"s":"ما کمی آب داریم.","full":"We have some water.","a":"audio/en-fa/47eb36c94962.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Sara has ___ orange.","options":["a","an"],"answer":1,"s":"سارا یک پرتقال دارد.","full":"Sara has an orange.","a":"audio/en-fa/558b9453e5e8.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"This is ___ apple.","answer":["an"],"s":"این یک سیب است.","full":"This is an apple.","a":"audio/en-fa/08726b113f15.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"I'd like ___ rice, please.","answer":["some"],"s":"لطفاً کمی برنج می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like some rice, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/e96db575cfbb.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"I'd like an orange, please.","s":"لطفاً یک پرتقال می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like an orange, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/304e8140a154.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"We have some bread.","s":"ما کمی نان داریم.","full":"We have some bread.","a":"audio/en-fa/b4ff1e9b537e.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"I like / I don't like / I'd like","s":"دوست دارم، دوست ندارم، می‌خواهم"},"explain":"برای گفتن چیزی که دوست داریم از **like** استفاده می‌کنیم: I **like** tea. (چای دوست دارم.)\nبرای منفی، قبل از like کلمهٔ **don't** می‌آید: I **don't like** coffee. (قهوه دوست ندارم.)\nبرای سؤال، **Do** را اول جمله می‌گذاریم: **Do you like** rice? جواب کوتاه: **Yes, I do.** یا **No, I don't.**\n**I'd like** (شکل کوتاه I would like) یعنی «می‌خواهم» یا «میل دارم». این جمله مؤدبانه است و برای سفارش و درخواست به‌کار می‌رود: I'd like some water, please.\nنکته: وقتی به‌طور کلی دربارهٔ چیزی شمردنی حرف می‌زنیم، آن را جمع می‌بندیم: I like apple**s**.","table":[["I like tea.","I don't like tea."],["We like rice.","We don't like rice."],["Do you like tea?","Yes, I do. / No, I don't."]],"examples":[{"t":"I like bananas.","s":"من موز دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/9fdbe7731abd.mp3"},{"t":"We don't like coffee.","s":"ما قهوه دوست نداریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/a0a13c3326bf.mp3"},{"t":"Do you like cheese? — Yes, I do.","s":"پنیر دوست داری؟ — بله، دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/63f580ff1038.mp3"},{"t":"I'd like some tea, please.","s":"لطفاً کمی چای می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/e9bd137bf9bc.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"I ___ like fish.","options":["don't","not","no"],"answer":0,"s":"من ماهی دوست ندارم.","full":"I don't like fish.","a":"audio/en-fa/fca83732131e.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Do you like eggs? — Yes, I ___.","options":["do","like","am"],"answer":0,"s":"تخم‌مرغ دوست داری؟ — بله، دوست دارم.","full":"Do you like eggs? — Yes, I do.","a":"audio/en-fa/ff6144737563.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"___ like a coffee, please.","options":["I'd","I'm","I"],"answer":0,"s":"لطفاً یک قهوه می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like a coffee, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/8a7c1e4c8aa0.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"I like ___.","options":["apple","apples"],"answer":1,"s":"من سیب دوست دارم.","full":"I like apples.","a":"audio/en-fa/9ba58ad737f5.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"We ___ like milk.","answer":["don't","don’t","do not"],"s":"ما شیر دوست نداریم.","full":"We don't like milk.","a":"audio/en-fa/61c1853088a4.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ you like tea?","answer":["Do"],"s":"چای دوست داری؟","full":"Do you like tea?","a":"audio/en-fa/910c05c18f16.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"I don't like coffee.","s":"من قهوه دوست ندارم.","full":"I don't like coffee.","a":"audio/en-fa/caec867e4544.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Do you like chicken?","s":"مرغ دوست داری؟","full":"Do you like chicken?","a":"audio/en-fa/bc21d6be7d8e.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Breakfast with Neda","s":"صبحانه با ندا","a":"audio/en-fa/b7dae6f6494e.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"My name is Neda, and I'm from Iran.","s":"اسم من ندا است و اهل ایران هستم.","a":"audio/en-fa/c5e71500e9ee.mp3"},{"t":"I like breakfast!","s":"من صبحانه را دوست دارم!","a":"audio/en-fa/7ae8157cc046.mp3"},{"t":"We have bread, cheese, and tea for breakfast.","s":"ما صبحانه نان، پنیر و چای می‌خوریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/c41faaab7eca.mp3"},{"t":"I like tea. I don't like coffee.","s":"من چای دوست دارم. قهوه دوست ندارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/6c4afe460f6e.mp3"},{"t":"My brother Amir and I like eggs.","s":"من و برادرم امیر تخم‌مرغ دوست داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/fd7eb41fdeb2.mp3"},{"t":"My mother has an apple and some milk.","s":"مادرم یک سیب و کمی شیر می‌خورد.","a":"audio/en-fa/42dca51beeea.mp3"},{"t":"Do you like breakfast, too?","s":"تو هم صبحانه دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/9895e34b0448.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"What do they have for breakfast?","s":"آن‌ها صبحانه چه می‌خورند؟","a":"audio/en-fa/abeb73aabed0.mp3"},"options":["bread, cheese, and tea","rice and chicken","orange juice"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Who has an apple?","s":"چه کسی یک سیب می‌خورد؟","a":"audio/en-fa/d9c2769da758.mp3"},"options":["Neda's mother","Neda's brother","Neda's sister"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Do Neda and Amir like eggs?","s":"آیا ندا و امیر تخم‌مرغ دوست دارند؟","a":"audio/en-fa/9d338dddacb5.mp3"},"options":["Yes, they do.","No, they don't."],"answer":0}]},"sentences":[{"t":"I'd like some water, please.","s":"لطفاً کمی آب می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/30dba32c6670.mp3"},{"t":"Do you like rice?","s":"برنج دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/82a98ec72ab7.mp3"},{"t":"We don't like coffee.","s":"ما قهوه دوست نداریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/a0a13c3326bf.mp3"},{"t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","a":"audio/en-fa/ffbb0dd0fb8a.mp3"},{"t":"An egg and some bread, please.","s":"یک تخم‌مرغ و کمی نان، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/72e66eb8f19c.mp3"},{"t":"They like oranges and bananas.","s":"آن‌ها پرتقال و موز دوست دارند.","a":"audio/en-fa/c3b21af97c00.mp3"},{"t":"Enjoy your meal!","s":"نوش جان!","a":"audio/en-fa/6357fe690b32.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f37d.svg"}